{"seq":2,"slug":"gradient-descent-variants","title":"梯度下降与变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/foundations/gradient-descent-variants","wordCount":1619,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"梯度下降与变体\">梯度下降与变体</h1><p>梯度下降的核心动作只有一行：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta \\leftarrow \\theta - \\eta \\nabla L(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，沿损失下降最快的负梯度方向迈一步，步长由学习率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 控制。但「计算这一步的梯度时用多少数据」是一个看似琐碎、实则决定训练全貌的选择。全量、单样本、小批量三种变体，在梯度精度、显存占用、收敛速度与硬件利用率之间做出截然不同的权衡。这一节把这场权衡讲清楚——它是理解为什么现代训练几乎清一色用「小批量随机梯度下降」的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三种批量变体\">核心概念：三种批量变体</h2><p>回忆<a href=\"optimization-landscape\">经验风险</a>是所有样本损失的平均，因此理论上最准确的梯度要把全部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个样本都算一遍。但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 动辄数十亿，每步都全量计算根本不可行。于是出现了用部分样本估计梯度的折中。三种变体的区别只在「每步用多少样本估计梯度」：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[一步更新需要梯度估计] --&gt; B{用多少样本}&#10;  B --&gt;|全部 N 个| C[批量梯度下降 BGD&lt;br/&gt;梯度准 / 显存炸 / 每步慢]&#10;  B --&gt;|单个样本| D[随机梯度下降 SGD&lt;br/&gt;梯度噪声大 / 更新快 / 难并行]&#10;  B --&gt;|一个小批量 B| E[小批量 SGD&lt;br/&gt;噪声适中 / 显存可控 / 矩阵运算高效]&#10;  E --&gt; F[现代训练的默认选择]\">flowchart TD\n  A[一步更新需要梯度估计] --&gt; B{用多少样本}\n  B --&gt;|全部 N 个| C[批量梯度下降 BGD&lt;br/&gt;梯度准 / 显存炸 / 每步慢]\n  B --&gt;|单个样本| D[随机梯度下降 SGD&lt;br/&gt;梯度噪声大 / 更新快 / 难并行]\n  B --&gt;|一个小批量 B| E[小批量 SGD&lt;br/&gt;噪声适中 / 显存可控 / 矩阵运算高效]\n  E --&gt; F[现代训练的默认选择]</pre><p>小批量 SGD 的更新式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta \\leftarrow \\theta - \\eta \\cdot \\frac{1}{|B|}\\sum_{i\\in B}\\nabla \\ell(f_\\theta(x_i), y_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6431em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是从训练集中随机抽取的一个小批量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|B|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是批量大小。它之所以胜出，既有统计原因（小批量梯度是真实梯度的无偏估计，噪声随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|B|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 增大而减小），也有硬件原因（GPU 擅长把一个批量打包成矩阵乘法，单样本则浪费算力）。</p>\n<p>下表对比三者：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变体</th>\n<th>每步样本数</th>\n<th>梯度噪声</th>\n<th>显存</th>\n<th>硬件利用率</th>\n<th>收敛特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>批量 BGD</td>\n<td>全部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>平滑但每步极慢，易陷鞍点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机 SGD</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>极大</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>噪声助逃逸但震荡剧烈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小批量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>8192</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32\\sim8192</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8192</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>适中</td>\n<td>可控</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>兼顾速度与稳定，事实标准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>框架里的实现短到几乎没有存在感——「用多少样本」这件事被藏在数据加载器的 <code>batch_size</code> 里，一次 <code>step</code> 就是一次小批量更新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"for x, y in loader:            # loader 以 batch_size = B 切分数据&#10;    loss = loss_fn(model(x), y)&#10;    loss.backward()            # 累积本批 B 个样本的梯度&#10;    optimizer.step()           # 沿 -η·(1/|B|)Σ∇ℓ 更新一次&#10;    optimizer.zero_grad()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x, y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loader:            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># loader 以 batch_size = B 切分数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss_fn(model(x), y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss.backward()            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 累积本批 B 个样本的梯度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizer.step()           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 沿 -η·(1/|B|)Σ∇ℓ 更新一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizer.zero_grad()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>改变 <code>batch_size</code> 就是在切换上表中的三种变体：设为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 退化成随机 SGD，设为整个数据集则变成批量 BGD。</p>\n<p>实际选批量大小时并没有唯一正解，而是几个约束互相拉扯的结果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束方向</th>\n<th>批量调大</th>\n<th>批量调小</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>显存与吞吐</td>\n<td>吃显存，但 GPU 利用率更高</td>\n<td>省显存，但算力常被浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梯度质量与泛化</td>\n<td>噪声小、更稳，但易陷尖锐极小</td>\n<td>噪声大，隐式正则强、泛化常更好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与学习率的匹配</td>\n<td>需按线性缩放法则同步抬高</td>\n<td>需相应调低，否则震荡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与 BatchNorm 等</td>\n<td>批量统计更可靠</td>\n<td>统计噪声大，归一化层表现变差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因此「批量」从来不能单独决定：它一旦改动，学习率、预热长度、正则强度往往都要连带重调，这正是后文<a href=\"../scaling/large-batch-distributed\">大批量训练</a>与<a href=\"../scaling/training-recipes\">训练配方</a>反复强调的耦合关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"梯度噪声-缺陷还是特性\">梯度噪声：缺陷还是特性</h2><p>直觉上梯度估计越准越好，但小批量带来的噪声其实是一把双刃剑，且常常偏向有益。噪声让参数更新带有随机扰动，这种扰动能帮助优化器跳出尖锐的局部极小与<a href=\"optimization-landscape\">鞍点</a>，倾向于找到更平坦、泛化更好的解。可以把它理解为一种隐式正则化——这也是为什么纯批量梯度下降在实践中反而泛化常常不如带噪声的小批量。</p>\n<p>噪声的强度大致与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta/\\sqrt{|B|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 成正比：学习率越大、批量越小，扰动越强。这个关系是<a href=\"../scaling/large-batch-distributed\">大批量训练</a>中「批量翻倍、学习率也要按比例调」这一经验法则的理论根源——增大批量降低了噪声，需要提高学习率把噪声补回来，才能维持相近的优化动力学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"朴素梯度下降的两大顽疾\">朴素梯度下降的两大顽疾</h2><p>固定学习率的朴素小批量 SGD 有两个广为人知的毛病。其一是病态曲率下的震荡：在<a href=\"optimization-landscape\">峡谷地形</a>中，梯度主要指向陡峭方向，更新会在谷壁间来回横跳，而沿谷底的前进却很慢。其二是平台与鞍点附近的停滞：梯度范数趋近于零，更新步长随之变得微小，训练长时间几乎不动。</p>\n<p>这两个顽疾正是后续优化器演化的直接动机。<a href=\"../optimizers/sgd-momentum\">动量方法</a>用历史梯度的指数平均抑制横向震荡、积累纵向速度，治的是第一个毛病；<a href=\"../optimizers/adaptive-adam\">自适应方法 Adam</a>按各方向梯度的历史幅度自动缩放步长，让平缓方向也能迈出合理的步子，治的是第二个毛病。可以说，整个优化器章都是在给朴素梯度下降「打补丁」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习率-最关键的单一旋钮\">学习率：最关键的单一旋钮</h2><p>即便不换优化器，学习率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 本身的取值也至关重要。它太大会让更新越过极小点甚至发散，loss 直接飞到 NaN；太小则收敛慢到不可接受，还容易卡在第一个遇到的平台。学习率与损失下降速度的关系通常呈一条 U 形曲线：存在一个「最优区间」，两侧都变差。</p>\n<p>寻找这个区间的经典手段是「学习率范围测试」——让学习率从极小指数增长到极大，观察 loss 随之变化的曲线，下降最陡的那段对应的学习率就是好的候选。而由于最优学习率本身会随训练阶段变化（初期需小、中期可大、末期再降），固定值往往不是最优，这就引出了<a href=\"../optimizers/lr-scheduling\">学习率调度与预热</a>整整一节的内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>梯度下降的基本动作是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta \\leftarrow \\theta - \\eta\\nabla L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，三种变体的唯一区别是每步用多少样本估计梯度。</li>\n<li>小批量 SGD 因兼顾梯度质量、显存可控与 GPU 矩阵运算效率，成为现代训练的事实标准。</li>\n<li>小批量噪声并非纯缺陷：它充当隐式正则化，帮助逃逸尖锐极小，噪声强度约正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta/\\sqrt{|B|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>朴素 SGD 在病态曲率下震荡、在平台鞍点处停滞，分别由动量与自适应方法在后续章节治理。</li>\n<li>学习率是单个最关键的旋钮，存在 U 形最优区间，且最优值随阶段变化，引出调度与预热。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"梯度下降与变体","id":"梯度下降与变体"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三种批量变体","id":"核心概念-三种批量变体"},{"level":2,"text":"梯度噪声：缺陷还是特性","id":"梯度噪声-缺陷还是特性"},{"level":2,"text":"朴素梯度下降的两大顽疾","id":"朴素梯度下降的两大顽疾"},{"level":2,"text":"学习率：最关键的单一旋钮","id":"学习率-最关键的单一旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"优化目标与损失地形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/foundations/optimization-landscape"},"next":{"title":"反向传播与自动微分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/dl-training-optimization/foundations/backprop-autodiff"}}